SUMMARY:I Play Rocky (2026)
LOCATION:Living Room Theaters\, 341 SW 10th Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5215;-122.6826
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Peter Farrelly · 128 min\n\nThe electrifying true story a
 bout an unknown actor with an unshakable belief that he wasn't just meant 
 to write Rocky—he was meant to be Rocky Balboa. Told "no" at every turn\
 , Sylvester Stallone bets everything on himself\, holding the line on play
 ing the lead against seemingly impossible odds.\n\nTickets: https://pdx.li
 vingroomtheaters.com/purchase/i-play-rocky?showingId=4354660\n\nMore showt
 imes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://pdx.livingroomtheaters.com/purchase/i-play-rocky?showingId=4354
 660
END:VEVENT
